WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.237
Let’s walk through Quick Capture.

00:00:02.237 --> 00:00:05.475
Record one observable point per capture and label whether it

00:00:05.475 --> 00:00:08.438
is an observation, moment, or direct quote.

00:00:08.438 --> 00:00:12.188
Keep interpretation distinct from quoted language and leave formal decisions

00:00:12.188 --> 00:00:13.887
in the artifact workflow.

00:00:13.887 --> 00:00:16.675
On this slide, record a concise note, moment

00:00:16.675 --> 00:00:18.788
, or quote during deliberation.

00:00:18.788 --> 00:00:22.363
In practice, label the observation accurately and leave formal

00:00:22.363 --> 00:00:24.950
team decisions in the artifact workflow.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.450
When you are ready, use Open Quick Capture to

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.137
move to the live surface.

00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:32.310
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:32.485
.
